# Commercial S12.1 CI source-freeze tag fetch diagnosis

- Scope: GitHub Actions validation of the immutable S12.0 source-freeze provenance.
- Observed failure: `test_old_source_freeze_remains_immutable` could not resolve
  `refs/tags/s12-yoti-sandbox-source-freeze-r1` in CI.
- Root cause: the default shallow `actions/checkout` invocation did not fetch the
  existing annotated source-freeze tag. The local and remote tag itself remained
  unchanged.
- Impact: CI-only provenance lookup failure; no runtime, manifest, provider, or
  boundary contract failed.
- Correction: fetch complete history and tags explicitly in the pinned checkout
  step (`fetch-depth: 0`, `fetch-tags: true`).
- Rollback: revert the two checkout inputs. No server or runtime state is involved.
